<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia jobs data confirms phone effect - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia jobs data confirms phone effect - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS) said on Thursday further analysis had confirmed its earlier calculation that its employment estimate was being reduced by 6,000 to 9,000 by each month of the phase-in of telephone interviewing.</p>
<p>&quot;Analysis continues to show no distinct pattern for either the unemployment or labour force participation rates,&quot; the bureau said.</p>
</text>
